      "updated": 1785840652270,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Kullanılacak Teknolojiler (Tech Stack):\n*Java Spring Boot\n*Java Spring Web\n*Spring Data JPA\n*Spring Security\n*JWT Authentication \n*Hibernate\n*Maven\n*React\n*React Router\n*Axios\n*Material UI\n*Flyway (Database Migration)\n*PostgreSQL (Relational DB)\n*Docker & Docker Compose\n*Git (VCS)\n*Swagger (OpenAPI)\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Kullanılacak Teknolojiler (Tech Stack):\n*Java Spring Boot\n*Java Spring Web\n*Spring Data JPA\n*Spring Security\n*JWT Authentication \n*Hibernate\n*Maven\n*React\n*React Router\n*Axios\n*Material UI\n*Flyway (Database Migration)\n*PostgreSQL (Relational DB)\n*Docker & Docker Compose\n*Git (VCS)\n*Swagger (OpenAPI)\n\n",
